<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dramaticallyIronicalTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates one dimension revealing information another dimension does not provide in memes, e.g. text revealing information visuals don't show"@en .
