<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01329#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'it's time to play cowboys' is mapped onto the visual depiction of the two men in cowboy attire, one holding a revolver and the other holding a lasso, who are seated and appear ready for confrontation. This mapping establishes that the visual subjects are being identified as 'cowboys' in the context of the text's call to action."@en .
