<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01329#western_american_culture> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is rooted in the cultural iconography of the American West, including cowboy attire, firearms, and rural settings. This cultural context is necessary to understand the visual and textual elements as references to a specific historical and cultural phenomenon, rather than just random imagery. The 'play cowboys' phrase implies a participation in or parody of this cultural trope."@en .
