<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01329#cowboy_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image relies on the cultural stereotype of cowboys as rugged, aggressive, and often violent men associated with the American West. This stereotype is reinforced by the visual elements (cowboy hats, guns, lasso) and the text 'it's time to play cowboys,' which invokes a romanticized yet often exaggerated and violent portrayal of cowboy culture. The meme uses this stereotype to create irony or shock by juxtaposing it with vulgar language."@en .
