<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01329#man_on_right> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An older Caucasian man wearing a light-colored cowboy hat and a green button-up shirt, holding a revolver with both hands and aiming it forward. He has a weathered face, a watch on his left wrist, and is seated in what appears to be a vehicle. His expression is serious and focused. This is a central visual element, conveying aggression and confrontation."@en .
