<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01329#assertion_about_01329> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme uses vulgar and confrontational language ('saddle up motherfuckers') to create a sense of aggression and shock, which can be perceived as abusive due to its crude tone and potential to provoke discomfort or offense."@en .
