<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01329#cowboys_ready_for_action> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The scene depicts two older men dressed in cowboy attire, seated in what appears to be a vehicle. One man is holding a revolver and aiming it forward, while the other holds a lasso. The text overlays suggest they are about to engage in a confrontational or aggressive activity, playing into a stereotypical cowboy theme. The spatial arrangement places the revolver-wielding man in the foreground and the lasso-holder slightly behind, creating a dynamic of readiness and aggression."@en .
